            <div xml:id="d356">

                <pb facs="0327" n="315" sameAs="frus:frus1942v04/pg315"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">891.77/706: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in Iran</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Dreyfus</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-11-25T19:00:00-04:00">November 25,
                            1942—7 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>341. Your 398, November 23. Department agrees that Iran Government should be
                    officially informed. We regard question of public statement as matter for
                    decision by Persian Gulf Service Command. War Department concurs.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
